d on it being in place first.\n\n## Notes\n- Use `src` layout (`src/agopengps/`) to avoid import ambiguity during development.\n- The C# projects map to Python subpackages: `Core → agopengps/core`, `AgLibrary → agopengps/library`, `AgIO → agopengps/agio`, `GPS → agopengps/gps`, `GPS_Out → agopengps/gps_out`, `ModSim → agopengps/modsim`.\n- Pin Python to 3.12+ in `pyproject.toml` to use `match` statements and `tomllib` from stdlib."
